1
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:23,522
Ludwick Marishane, a young man from South Africa, was with his friends in Limpopo when they started talking about inventing something to put on your skin so you don’t have to take a bath.

2
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,900
Ludwick thought that this was a great idea.

3
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:33,518
He used his mobile to do some research on the internet, and he found some shocking facts.

4
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:38,568
Millions of people around the world haven’t got clean water.

5
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:44,600
This is a huge problem because dirty water can create terrible illnesses.

6
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:52,465
One of them is trachoma: thousands of people all over the world get trachoma every year.

7
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:59,720
They wash their faces with dirty water, get an infection and sometimes become blind.

8
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:05,550
To stop trachoma, people don’t have to take expensive medication.

9
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,360
They don’t have to take pills.

10
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,460
They don’t have to have injections.

11
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:13,747
They have to wash their faces with clean water.

12
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:14,815
That’s it.

13
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:17,760
Ludwick started thinking.

14
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:25,148
He wanted to make something to help people in parts of the world where it’s difficult to find clean water.

15
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:30,220
He did more research on his mobile, and he did more thinking.

16
00:01:31,380 --> 00:01:32,787
Ludwick had a plan.

17
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:39,260
He wanted to make a gel for people to put on their skin so they don’t have to take a bath.

18
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:43,440
He wrote the formula for the gel on his mobile phone.

19
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:49,340
When he was at university, he never stopped thinking about his invention.

20
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:57,087
He started to talk to other people about it, and three years later the dream came true.

21
00:01:57,980 --> 00:02:00,900
He made the gel and called it ‘DryBath’.

22
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:05,434
It looks like any other gel, but it isn’t.

23
00:02:06,003 --> 00:02:07,780
This gel saves lives!

24
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:13,224
Ludwick Marishane is the winner of lots of prizes.

25
00:02:13,970 --> 00:02:17,799
People call him ‘one of the brightest young men in the world’.

26
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,640
He is very happy about his success.

27
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:24,463
DryBath is helping people to be healthy.

28
00:02:24,463 --> 00:02:28,167
And DryBath also helps to save water.

29
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:34,111
That’s important in many parts of the world where it’s difficult to find clean water.

30
00:02:35,260 --> 00:02:41,980
Now he wants to invent other things, and he wants to help other young people to become inventors, too.
